OL,3,GNEWSAMum's plight inspires son to
OL,4,Atackle loneliness
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man inspired by his mum's loneliness
OL,7,Fafter the death of her partner has
OL,8,Fdeveloped a friend-finding app for
OL,9,Fpeople in Guernsey.
OL,11,FIan Price said his mother's experience
OL,12,Fshowed how easy it could be to become
OL,13,Flonely and he wanted to help "bridge
OL,14,Fthe gap" for those feeling alone.
OL,16,FMarlene Price, 76, lost her partner
OL,17,Faround two and a half years ago and
OL,18,Ffound it difficult to adjust to life
OL,19,Falone. She said the app created by her
OL,20,Fson "would help a lot of people".
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
