OL,3,GNEWSAMum's plight inspires son to
OL,4,Atackle loneliness
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I find that because I haven't got any
OL,7,Fclose friends, it can be very lonely.
OL,8,FIf you've got someone who can just pop
OL,9,Fin and have a cup of tea or something,
OL,10,Fit makes a difference."
